Package: gamepi-remote-input
Version: 0.1.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Gamepi <archie2x@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: gamepi-kiosk (>= 0.1.0), python3, kmod, udev, libtls28t64, libwayland-client0, libxkbcommon0, libc6
Description: Gamepi SSH keyboard and mouse receiver
 Supplies Waynergy, its Mac keyboard mapping and persistent uinput access.
 Receives input through an SSH tunnel started from the Mac; no network
 listener or receiver service is enabled at boot.
